msgid "Suggest replies"
msgstr "Foreslå svar"

#: ui/ai-summary.slint:264
msgid "Suggesting replies…"
msgstr "Foreslår svar…"

#: ui/ai.slint:51
msgid "The server didn't accept the key."
msgstr "Serveren accepterede ikke nøglen."

#: ui/ai.slint:52
msgid ""
"The server can't be reached. Check the address and that the server is "
"running."
msgstr "Serveren kan ikke nås. Kontrollér adressen, og at serveren kører."

#: ui/ai.slint:53 ui/translation.slint:81
msgid ""
"The server address has to start with https://, or with http://localhost for "
"a server on this computer."
msgstr ""
"Serveradressen skal starte med https:// eller med http://localhost for en "
"server på denne computer."

#: ui/ai.slint:54
msgid "Choose a model first."
msgstr "Vælg først en model."

#: ui/ai.slint:55
msgid ""
"The server has no model called {}. Choose one of its models and save again."
msgstr ""
"Serveren har ingen model kaldet {}. Vælg en af dens modeller, og gem igen."

#: ui/ai.slint:56
msgid "The server didn't answer as expected. It said: {}"
msgstr "Serveren svarede ikke som forventet. Den sagde: {}"

#: ui/ai.slint:57
msgid "The server didn't answer as expected."
msgstr "Serveren svarede ikke som forventet."

#: ui/ai.slint:108
msgid ""
"Summaries, suggested replies and help with writing come from an AI server "
"you choose, on this computer or hosted. Nothing is sent until you use one of "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Oversigter, foreslåede svar og hjælp til skrivning kommer fra en AI-server, "
"du vælger, på denne computer eller hostet. Intet sendes, før du bruger en af "
"dem."

#: ui/ai.slint:127 ui/network.slint:128 ui/network.slint:144
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Server"

#: ui/ai.slint:129
msgid ""
"Any server with the OpenAI chat API works. Ollama and LM Studio run models "
"on this computer, so what you send stays here."
msgstr ""
"Enhver server med OpenAI chat-API virker. Ollama og LM Studio kører modeller "
"på denne computer, så det, du sender, forbliver her."

