msgid "Create a new key"
msgstr "Opret en ny nøgle"

#: ui/components/account-mail-preferences.slint:575
msgid ""
"New keys expire in two years. GnuPG asks you to protect the private key with "
"a passphrase."
msgstr ""
"Nye nøgler udløber efter to år. GnuPG beder dig om at beskytte den private "
"nøgle med en adgangsfrase."

#: ui/components/account-mail-preferences.slint:576
